Light Bound v1.0.2 Patch Notes: 

- Mac OS X Support added;
- Mouse cursor displays when movement is detected and hides after 3 seconds without movement;
- Fixed a bug in all arena game modes where selecting infinite rounds would cause the game to end after one round;

